OL,3,GNEWSA'Undeliverable' hotel site plans
OL,4,Aabandoned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA proposed seafront development has
OL,7,Fbeen abandoned - meaning an old hotel
OL,8,Fcould be demolished with no plans for
OL,9,Fanything to replace it.
OL,11,FDevelopers Salboy said its plans to
OL,12,Fturn Hotel Bristol in Newquay,
OL,13,FCornwall, into 143 apartments would not
OL,14,Ftake place, but it was due to seek
OL,15,Fplanning permission to allow its
OL,16,Fdemolition.
OL,18,FThe company said: "Market conditions
OL,19,Fhave rendered the scheme unfundable and
OL,20,Fhence undeliverable."
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
